# 32LR655BPUA, the US 32-inch LR65: the models DB lists it for this OTA ID (W23L 13.50.75.01, markets
# US and CA_EN). The default board (board_cmdline in guest/targets/soc/), from
# host/tools/research/model-config.py: hwopt digit 0 5 (countryType US, nyx-option-gen ATSC), LVDS,
# HD, graphic plane 1280x720 (U-Boot's default panel KF23F_1366x768_LVDS_60Hz), DDR 1.5G (the board's
# own is not in the firmware; W23P's and W22L's). countryGrp 2: configd's USA RMM grpCode (the
# all-zero line's group is 1). tvregion ATSC: the broadcast system. ToolOpt: LLS's factory default
# record of this line, with the LR65/32" panelInch and toolType of the firmware's factory tables.
# Identity placeholders are replaced per VM.
ethaddr=02:00:00:12:34:56
devtmpfs.mount=1
countryGrp=2
modelopt=000000000
hwopt=501000000003006000
ToolOpt=33577862:1310742:38912:65:3671095:55627521
modelName=32LR655BPUA
debugMode=3
serialNum=000RAXX00001
chip=KF23FA0
tvregion=ATSC
emmc_size=0x1d2000000
cmdEnd
